              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi abaza Ahimeleki Umuheti na Abishayi umwana wa Seruwiya, murumuna wa Yowabu, ati Ni nde yomanukana nanje aho Sauli ashagaje? Abishayi aramwishura, ati Jewe turajana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi na Abishayi bahenga mw ijoro baragenda, bashika mur’ izo ngabo, basanga Sauli yībīkiriye hagati y’aho bārāza imikogote y’intambara, icumu ryiwe rishinze haruguru y’umutwe wiwe, Abuneri n’ingabo baryamye bamukikije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
