          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi afata hakurya, ahagarara ku gatwe k’umusozi witereye, har’ akarēre katari gato hagati yabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atera akamo ingabo bo na Abuneri mwene Neri, ati Abuneri we, mbega k’udakakaza! Abuneri aramwishura, at’ Uri nde, wewe uhamagara umwami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi abarira Abuneri, ati Mbega ntur’ umuntu w’umugabo? Har’ ūhwanye nawe mu Bisirayeli? None se k’utāteramiye umwami shobuja? Hari haje umuntu aho muri, aje kwica umwami, kand’ ari we shobuja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
