        {
          "text": "Eka ivyo wakoze si vyiza! Mbarahiye uguhoraho kw’Uhoraho, mwari mukwiye gupfa, kuko mutāteramiye shobuja, uwo Uhoraho yimikishije amavuta! Noneho ni musuzume icumu ry’ umwami n’umukuza w’amazi vyari haruguru y’umutwe w’umwami kw ari ho bikiri.",
          "type": "text",
