              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero ntiwemere kw amaraso yanje azosēswa kure y’ah’ Uhoraho aba; erega mwami w’ Abisirayeli, wazanywe no guhīga imbaragasa, nk’ūhīga inkware mu misozi.",
