          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nk’ukw amagara yawe yabaye agakomeye kuri jewe uyu musi, az’ abe ari kw ayanje aba agakomeye k’Uhoraho, ankize amagorwa yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
